SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- NWRT Columbia Crossings to Molly's Cafe (24R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating sta
 rt location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile rout
 es\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for r
 efreshment/coffee mid-route at either [Molly's Courtyard Cafe](https://www
 .mollyscourtyardcafe.com/)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not 
 have a single pace.\nThere will be multiple regroup points during the ride
 .\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to
  stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A p
 lanned stop to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other c
 yclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the 
 last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride
  with GPS](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36108644)\n\nHelmets are mandato
 ry. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, t
 ire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and 
 paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to joi
 n this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join
  here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=2
 57148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Con
 duct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clu
 bexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, a
 nd [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn ca
 se of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/
 ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf
 ?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-content-d
 isposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwx
 GJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3159205
 37/
